{{Caption|An N-star grid blending a star-shaped corner where multiple surfaces meet}}

==Usage==

# Select three to six [[Image:Silk_SubGrid63_2Surf64.svg|16px]] [[Silk_SubGrid63_2Surf64|SubGrid63_2Surf64]] objects sequentially, counter-clockwise, looking from the outer side.
# There are several ways to invoke the command.
#* Press the {{Button|[[Image:Silk_ControlGridNStar66.svg|16px]] ControlGridNStar66}} button.
#* Select the {{MenuCommand|Silk → [[Image:Silk_ControlGridNStar66.svg|16px]] ControlGridNStar66}} option from the menu.
# A '''ControlGridNStar66''' object, is created.

